; 3.6367 x 2.759 m: the shipped drawing's exact 1388:1053 fitted inside
; BubbleTestLayout.SecretPictureMountM (8.759 x 2.759, each bound being the surface less one whole
; AvatarProportions.PlayerCrownM of margin). The height binds. A QuadMesh faces +Z, which is into
; the room from the north wall. SetUpSecretPicture recomputes this size from whatever image is on
; disk, so a swapped drawing of another aspect is refitted rather than stretched.
[sub_resource type="QuadMesh" id="QuadMesh_picture_F"]
